A-04's 14 errors are all `layout canvas_overflow` at t=11.2s plus one
`escaped_container` on div.ds-zoom. Removing the single `inside:
{beat:"b01-method-flow", element:"stage0"}` field — a schema-legal camera dive,
accepted by coherence.mjs's own inside/element check — turns FAIL into PASS.
The shipped demo storyboard never uses `inside`, so the dive path ships untested.

The warning present in every run, including the shipped demo, is
`connector_detached ... 380px from the nearest anchorable element` on the
pipeline's feedback loop. See the review: that connector is drawing the wrong
claim, and has been since the demo was written.
